## Single-Atom Catalysis
Singles Club: A general strategy enabling the practical and controlled synthesis of supported metal single-atom catalysts with atomic dispersion, high metal loading, and excellent molecular accessibility has been developed and applied to a series of metal single atoms supported on N-doped carbon.
